english.DependencyInteractiveRequired=Dependencies have not been downloaded or verified. Run the interactive installer or uncheck automatic dependency installation.
chinesesimp.DependencyDownloadRequired=组件尚未下载或校验，请重新运行安装程序。
english.DependencyDownloadRequired=Components have not been downloaded or verified. Run the installer again.
chinesesimp.InstallCapture=正在安装 TShark / Wireshark，请确认 Windows 管理员授权…
english.InstallCapture=Installing TShark / Wireshark. Confirm the Windows administrator prompt...
chinesesimp.NpcapLicense=请在 Npcap 官方窗口确认许可并完成安装，然后返回。
english.NpcapLicense=Accept the license and complete installation in the official Npcap window, then return here.
chinesesimp.VerifyCapture=正在验证网卡并保存 TShark 路径…
english.VerifyCapture=Verifying adapters and saving the TShark path...
