english.PrepareJava=Preparing JDK / Arthas and saving settings...
chinesesimp.SelectComponents=选择安装内容。优先复用已有组件；缺少 JDK 时下载独立 JDK 21，不修改系统环境变量。
english.SelectComponents=Choose components to install. Existing components are reused. If needed, a separate JDK 21 is downloaded without changing system environment variables.
chinesesimp.NpcapInteractive=Npcap 免费版需在官方窗口确认许可及安装，不能完全静默安装。
english.NpcapInteractive=The free Npcap edition requires license acceptance and installation in its official window. Fully silent installation is unavailable.
